@startuml state-03-product
' Sơ đồ trạng thái — Trạng thái sản phẩm (products.status)
' Verify vs backend/src/modules/admin/services/admin-product-service.js
'   (createProduct L114 default active, cloneProduct L1065 force draft,
'    updateProduct L439 passthrough, toggleProductStatus L1127 validStatuses)
' Verify vs backend/src/modules/admin/validators/admin-validator.js
'   (updateProductSchema L44 passthrough — không validate status)
hide empty description
skinparam dpi 300
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #DAE8FC
  BorderColor #6C8EBF
  FontColor #000000
  ArrowColor #4D4D4D
}

state "tạo sản phẩm" as init <<choice>>
[*] --> init

state "Đang bán\n(active)" as active
state "Không bán\n(inactive)" as inactive
state "Nháp\n(draft)" as draft

init --> active : [createProduct — mặc định]
init --> draft  : [cloneProduct — nhân bản]

active   --> inactive : staff update [target=inactive]
inactive --> active   : staff update [target=active]

active   --> draft    : staff update [target=draft]
draft    --> active   : staff update [target=active]

inactive --> draft    : staff update [target=draft]
draft    --> inactive : staff update [target=inactive]

active   --> [*] : deleteProduct / soft delete
inactive --> [*] : deleteProduct / soft delete
draft    --> [*] : deleteProduct / soft delete

/'
note bottom
  • createProduct: status mặc định 'active' nếu không truyền (L114).
  • cloneProduct (nhân bản): luôn khởi tạo 'draft' (L1065).
  • toggleProductStatus (L1127): validStatuses = ['active','inactive','draft'].
    Default toggle (không truyền status): active→inactive; draft/inactive→active.
  • updateProduct (L439): cho phép set bất kỳ status nào vì
    updateProductSchema dùng .passthrough() — không validate status field.
  • 'archived' tồn tại trong DB ENUM nhưng không có code path nào set.
  • Sản phẩm status != 'active' bị chặn đặt hàng tại createOrder (L186/L214).
end note
'/
@enduml
